{
  "about": "Test questions for the agent on the Kvitta data. q01-q10 are the demo questions in kvitta/demofrågor.md; q11-q18 check single layers, the chunks of the long design document and small talk. q19-q27 are control questions: similar questions in other words or about other stories, never used to tune the agent; if one fails, fix the agent in a general way, never the question. expected_evidence: groups of node specs; a group passes when any spec matches a node in the evidence (label, plus name or a case-insensitive part of the name). expected_terms: groups of words; a group passes when any variant appears in the answer (case-insensitive). expected_facts: the same, on the facts in the evidence. Names of events, root causes and components come from the LLM layers and can change when those layers are rebuilt; update this file then.",
